  "verified_directly": "clang -Os lowers to imul plus shr (reciprocal multiply); clang -Oz emits `div %ecx`. gcc emits `idiv %ecx` at both -Os and -Oz. Read from the disassembly, not inferred from a count.",
  "not_done": "This extends the FLAG axis only. Extending the compiler-version axis, adding MSVC, and mapping real distribution package flags onto the emitting cells would each need toolchain images this artifact does not pin, and none of that is attempted here. What can be said from the measurement is that the emitting set grows as the flag axis is explored, so eight cells was a lower bound on how many shipped configurations carry the division, not an estimate of it."
